pluginstrument.description:
Prop Amps gauge, moves to the configured number of amps when the prop de-ice is turned on. This is a setable value because there is no prop amps dataref or prop amps variable.
An instrument fitted the Baron B58 instrument set.
@screen size 1440 x 900 for a full screen panel, the geometry can be set to: (x, y, w, h) 0, 640, 160, 160
